    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 4.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ swa hi doð symle, swa oft swa hig geornlice inweardre heortan clypiað to Criste ⁊ for folces neode þingiað georne, ⁊ þi man sceal for Godes ege mæðe on hade gecnawan mid gesceade.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And that they always do as often as they earnestly call upon Christ from their inmost heart, and zealously make intercession for the needs of the people, and therefore the various ranks in holy orders must be recognised and distinguished for the fear of God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ swa hi doð symle, swa oft swa hig geornlice inweardre heortan clypiað to Criste ⁊ for folces neode þingiað georne; ⁊ þi man sceal for Godes ege mæðe on hade gecnawan mid gesceade.</ab>
      </div>
